From 554e4873b4c96a2cf017bf6802083dfed07cbe8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:55:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: Sisong, the programmer's editor

Sisong 2.16 (Caitlin Shaw, GPL 3), ported in ProseApps' ports section
and built by prosepkg from there: tabs, syntax colouring, a function
list, brace matching, find in files, projects with build scripts and a
build pane. In the Deskbar's Development folder, beside Pe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0070-prose-profile-sisong-the-programmer-s-editor.patch c40dcbe58484b197cd128d260e95b557a572f748fe712f1bd47b64fd9aefa86a
---
 build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles          | 1 +
 build/jam/DeskbarCategories             | 1 +
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

